@startuml UserLoginSequence

actor "用户" as User
participant "Vue3 Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Python Backend" as Backend
database "MySQL Database" as Database

User -> Frontend: 输入用户名和密码
Frontend -> Backend: POST /login {username, password}
activate Backend

Backend -> Database: 查询用户 (SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = ...)
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 返回用户数据
deactivate Database

Backend -> Backend: 验证密码

alt 密码正确
    Backend -> Database: 查询用户角色和菜单权限 (SELECT roles.*, menus.* FROM ...)
    activate Database
    Database --> Backend: 返回角色和菜单数据
    deactivate Database
    Backend --> Frontend: 返回登录成功响应 (包含 token, 用户信息, 菜单权限)
else 密码错误或用户不存在
    Backend --> Frontend: 返回错误响应 (如: "用户名或密码错误")
end

deactivate Backend
Frontend -> Frontend: 处理响应 (存储 token, 导航到主页或显示错误信息)

@enduml